    "description": {
      "value": "<p>如果你拥有施法或契约魔法职业能力，暴风龙纹表中的法术将加入你施法职业的法术列表中。</p>\n<table style=\"width:222.03pt\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:66pt\"></col><col style=\"width:156pt\"></col></colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height:15px\">\n<td class=\"et2\" style=\"height:15px;width:87px\">法术环位</td>\n<td class=\"et2\" style=\"width:207px;height:15px\">法术</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"et3\" style=\"width:87px\">1</td>\n<td class=\"et4\" style=\"width:207px\">羽落术，云雾术。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"et3\" style=\"width:87px\">2</td>\n<td class=\"et4\" style=\"width:207px\">造风术，浮空术。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"et3\" style=\"width:87px\">3</td>\n<td class=\"et4\" style=\"width:207px\">雪雨暴，风墙术。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height:29px\">\n<td class=\"et3\" style=\"height:29px;width:87px\">4</td>\n<td class=\"et4\" style=\"width:207px;height:29px\">召唤次级元素生物，操控水体。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"et3\" style=\"width:87px\">5</td>\n<td class=\"et4\" style=\"width:207px\">召唤元素生物。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
